Subject: [PATCH 1/5] kpi: safe copyin/copyout and ioctl argument access
 (usercopy)

UserSlice carries a user address that can only be used through
copyin/copyout; IoctlData is the kernel copy of an ioctl argument with
size-checked typed access through the FromBytes/AsBytes marker traits.
